<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Spettin</unclear></persName>, (so sich inn E. E. W. statt uufhalten soll.)
<lb n="8"/>onn unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">supplicirt</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> unnser
<lb n="9"/>fürschrifft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepetten</unclear>, das ist auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inligender</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>seiner, unns ubergebnen supplication,
<lb n="11"/>nottürftig zuvernemen.
<lb n="12"/>Dieweil wir dann die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrigen</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befuegsamme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobefürdern</unclear>, nitt
